This consistently fails on 656b734a5f871bc0d83a490cb1bad67448a7e8fe in ~5s and runs for several minutes on 21a8b5f77fc25e1340fb0b9645af8929f1c77589 until I interrupt it, so I think this is almost certainly the root cause.

